--- !u!114 &1596729774
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1596729772}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d20f73aabcb4cfbaac49363662be3e1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueController
  currentDialogueIndex: 0
  textStartOffset: 0
  dialogues:
  - texts:
    - Ah...
    - It walks willingly into the clutches of death...?
    - Yorba has not tasted meat in soo long...
    - Too cold to hunt outside...
    - Keke... Yorba senses its nature... if Yorba ate it, Yorba would explode in
      a big ball of fire...
    - Or something like that.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - Yorba used to feast on all sorts of creatures...
    - Scrumptious meals, right in Yorba's web, lured by Yorba's beautiful music.
    - Until one day... those wretched winter winds...
    - They swept Yorba's <color=yellow>erhu</color> right out of Yorba's bristly
      grip.
    - Not an easy feat. Yorba has many appendages with which to grip the <color=yellow>erhu</color>.
    - Yorba's wonderful instrument... smashed to pieces against the rocks...
    - No meat since then...
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - If only Yorba had Yorba's <color=yellow>erhu</color> to lure in creatures to
      eat...
    - So hungry... keke...
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - Oh?
    - It has found a part of Yorba's <color=yellow>erhu</color>?
    - Three pieces, Yorba needs, to make the instrument whole again...
    - The neck, the tuner, and the body, keke.
    - They're probably out there, hidden in the crags.
    - If it is rebuilt, the scrumptious creatures may come back to Yorba's web...
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - Yorba can almost taste the meat of those yummy creatures...
    - Yorba just needs the three components of Yorba's <color=yellow>erhu</color>...
    - The pieces are likely scattered on the rocks around here...
    - Too cold for Yorba to go look... ke...
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - Keke... keKEKEKE?
    - Please forgive Yorba's outburst...
    - But it has collected the entirety of Yorba's <color=yellow>erhu</color>...
    - Please... little thing... it must give them to Yorba...
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - It must forgive Yorba's rusty technique. Long has it been since Yorba has played.
    - Yorba feels... an unusual feeling. Gratitude...?
    - ...No, surely not. Yorba is not an emotional weakling.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: -3.5
  - texts:
    - It is still here?
    - It must not disturb Yorba's playing. Or the scrumptious creatures will not
      come near.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: -3.5
  DialogueName: Yorba
  LookAtOverride: {fileID: 989974922}
  CameraY: 0.45
  canvasDelay: 3.5
  cameraFollowOffsetLerp: 0
